  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with the bright whites, the dark brown iris, pupil, catchlights and the upper lash line baked into the body atlas; the plum mask band across the eyes, the brows, the nose, the wide smile with two tiny fangs and the whisker dots are baked into the body. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head, showing the closed lid (mask plum, sculpted and painted on the body under the lens).",
